    "created_at": "2022-08-09T09:04:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-09T09:04:38Z",
    "body": "Regarding the question of which issues in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4184#issuecomment-1072536425 should be considered blocking for writing up a spec of https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/dialog--initial-focus,-a-proposal#initial-dialog-focus-logic : I think we should come up with an opinion here, but it is a minor question and should not block writing up a spec PR, as it's just a question as to whether to include or not include a single sentence in that PR.\r\n\r\nI am interested in the opinion of folks like @sideshowbarker and @zcorpan on whether the proposed conformance requirement in the OP would be useful.",
